srem3: x % 3, for x from -999 to 999, with the sign of x. Inline: no call.
Listed at cells 10-28, with x in cell 90 and a scratch cell t0 in cell 91.
Copy cells 10-28 to where the program needs x % 3, with each 90 changed to the program's cell for x and each 91 to a free cell; the program goes on with x % 3 in the accumulator.
It overwrites the accumulator and t0; x is kept.
Size 20 cells (19 instructions and t0). It runs 19 instructions, straight through.
Exact over the domain.

